#: includes/api/class-users-controller.php:779
msgid "We couldn't delete your account. Please try again or contact support."
msgstr "계정을 삭제하지 못했어요. 다시 시도하거나 지원팀에 문의해 주세요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:47
msgid "Forum Content"
msgstr "포럼 콘텐츠"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:48
msgid "Create, read, and manage forum posts and replies."
msgstr "포럼 글과 답글을 작성, 조회, 관리해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:55
msgid "Community Spaces"
msgstr "커뮤니티 스페이스"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:56
msgid "Manage community spaces (forums, Q&A boards, idea boards)."
msgstr "커뮤니티 스페이스(포럼, Q&A 게시판, 아이디어 게시판)를 관리해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:63
msgid "Community Users"
msgstr "커뮤니티 멤버"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:64
msgid "User profiles, notifications, and subscriptions."
msgstr "멤버 프로필, 알림, 구독을 관리해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:71
msgid "Content Moderation"
msgstr "콘텐츠 신고·관리"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:72
msgid "Flag, review, and moderate community content."
msgstr "커뮤니티 콘텐츠를 신고, 검토, 관리해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:79
msgid "Community Search"
msgstr "커뮤니티 검색"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:80
msgid "Search posts, spaces, users, and tags across the community."
msgstr "커뮤니티 전체에서 글, 스페이스, 멤버, 태그를 검색해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:106
msgid "Create Post"
msgstr "게시물 작성"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:107
msgid ""
"Create a new topic, question, or discussion post in a community space. "
"Supports tags and auto-subscribes the author."
msgstr "커뮤니티 스페이스에 새 토픽, 질문, 토론 게시물을 작성해요. 태그를 지원하며 작성자를 자동으로 구독 등록해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:196
msgid "Get Post"
msgstr "게시물 조회"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:197
msgid ""
"Retrieve a single forum post by ID, including its author, vote score, reply "
"count, and metadata."
msgstr "ID로 포럼 게시물 하나를 조회해요. 작성자, 투표 점수, 답글 수, 메타데이터를 포함해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:246
msgid "List Posts"
msgstr "게시물 목록"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:247
msgid ""
"List posts in a community space with pagination. Returns titles, authors, "
"scores, and reply counts."
msgstr "커뮤니티 스페이스의 게시물을 페이지 단위로 나열해요. 제목, 작성자, 점수, 답글 수를 반환해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:308
msgid "Create Reply"
msgstr "답글 작성"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:309
msgid ""
"Reply to an existing forum post. Supports threaded replies up to 3 levels "
"via parent_id."
msgstr "기존 포럼 게시물에 답글을 달아요. parent_id를 통해 최대 3단계 스레드 답글을 지원해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:347 includes/class-abilities.php:1290
#: includes/class-abilities.php:1349 includes/class-abilities.php:1788
#: includes/moderation/class-moderation-service.php:966
msgid "Post not found."
msgstr "게시물을 찾을 수 없어요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:378
msgid "List Replies"
msgstr "답글 목록"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:379
msgid ""
"List replies for a forum post with pagination. Includes author info, vote "
"scores, and thread structure."
msgstr "포럼 게시물의 답글을 페이지 단위로 나열해요. 작성자 정보, 투표 점수, 스레드 구조를 포함해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:442
msgid "Vote on Content"
msgstr "콘텐츠 투표"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:443
msgid ""
"Upvote or downvote a post or reply. Toggles if voting the same direction "
"again."
msgstr "게시물이나 답글을 추천하거나 비추천해요. 같은 방향으로 다시 투표하면 취소돼요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:486
msgid "Authentication required."
msgstr "로그인이 필요해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:510
msgid "List Spaces"
msgstr "스페이스 목록"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:511
msgid ""
"List all community spaces (forums, Q&A boards, idea boards) the current "
"user can access, grouped by category."
msgstr "현재 사용자가 접근할 수 있는 모든 커뮤니티 스페이스(포럼, Q&A 게시판, 아이디어 게시판)를 카테고리별로 묶어 나열해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:554
msgid "Get Space Details"
msgstr "스페이스 상세 정보"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:555
msgid ""
"Retrieve detailed information about a community space including "
"description, rules, member count, and settings."
msgstr "설명, 규칙, 멤버 수, 설정을 포함한 커뮤니티 스페이스의 상세 정보를 조회해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:600
msgid "Join Space"
msgstr "스페이스 가입"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:601
msgid ""
"Join a community space as a member. For private spaces, this submits a join "
"request for moderator approval."
msgstr "커뮤니티 스페이스에 멤버로 가입해요. 비공개 스페이스는 운영자 승인을 받을 수 있도록 가입 요청을 제출해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:644
msgid "List Space Members"
msgstr "스페이스 멤버 목록"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:645
msgid ""
"List members of a community space with their roles, trust levels, and "
"reputation."
msgstr "커뮤니티 스페이스의 멤버를 역할, 신뢰 레벨, 평판과 함께 나열해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:691
msgid "Create Space"
msgstr "스페이스 만들기"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:692
msgid ""
"Create a new community space (forum, Q&A, ideas, or social). Requires "
"administrator or jetonomy_manage_settings capability."
msgstr ""
"새 커뮤니티 스페이스(포럼, Q&A, 아이디어, 소셜)를 만들어요. 관리자 또는 jetonomy_manage_settings 권한이 "
"필요해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:762
msgid "Get User Profile"
msgstr "사용자 프로필 조회"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:763
msgid ""
"Retrieve a community member's profile including bio, trust level, "
"reputation, post/reply counts, and badges."
msgstr "커뮤니티 멤버의 프로필(소개, 신뢰 레벨, 평판, 게시물/답글 수, 배지 포함)을 조회해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:807
msgid "List Notifications"
msgstr "알림 목록"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:808
msgid ""
"List the current user's community notifications (replies, mentions, votes, "
"badges) with read/unread status."
msgstr "현재 사용자의 커뮤니티 알림(답글, 멘션, 투표, 배지)을 읽음/읽지 않음 상태와 함께 나열해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:860
msgid "Mark Notifications Read"
msgstr "알림 읽음 표시"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:861
msgid "Mark one or all of the current user's notifications as read."
msgstr "현재 사용자의 알림 하나 또는 전체를 읽음으로 표시해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:901
msgid "Get Activity Feed"
msgstr "활동 피드 조회"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:902
msgid ""
"Retrieve the community activity feed showing recent posts, replies, votes, "
"and other events."
msgstr "최근 게시물, 답글, 투표 등 다양한 이벤트를 보여주는 커뮤니티 활동 피드를 조회해요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:970
msgid "Flag Content"
msgstr "콘텐츠 신고"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:971
msgid ""
"Report a post, reply or member for moderator review. Provide a reason "
"(spam, offensive, off_topic, harassment, other)."
msgstr ""
"게시물, 답글 또는 멤버를 운영자가 검토하도록 신고해요. 사유(spam, offensive, off_topic, harassment, "
"other)를 입력해 주세요."

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1031
msgid "Moderate Content"
msgstr "콘텐츠 관리"

#: includes/class-abilities.php:1032
msgid ""
"Take moderation action on flagged content. Approve, trash, or mark as spam. "
"Requires moderator or administrator role."
msgstr "신고된 콘텐츠에 운영 조치를 취해요. 승인, 휴지통 이동, 스팸 표시를 할 수 있어요. 운영자 또는 관리자 역할이 필요해요."

